window.products.push({"id":396202,"name":"Stand Mixer, 7.5QT Mixers Kitchen Electric Stand Mixer, 6+1Speed Tilt-Head Dough Mixer with Bowl, Dough Hook, Whisk, Beater, Egg Separator(Black) 660W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znqAhCNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍔【7.5 QT Large Capacity Bowl】This stand mixer set included a 7.5-quart mixing bowl, which is made of premium stainless steel to ensure long life and safe operation. Large capacity means you can mix the dough, in a single batch for 6 loaves of bread, 9 pounds of mashed potatoes, or 11 dozen cookies. This electric stand mixer for baking comes with a dough hook, beater, whisk, egg separator and Splash-proof cover to meet your different needs. 🍞【660W Powerful & Durable】 This stand mixer built-in a powerful Clash F level 660W Motor, and it is lower operation noise ≤76dB. The unique design of heat dissipation ensured you can use it for a longer time. This dough stand mixer is powerful performance of planetary mixing action for mixing bread dough, thick batters, meringues, and whipping cream. Definitely one of the best appliances in your kitchen. 🧀【6+1 Speeds Options】The electric stand mixer has 6 adjustable speeds and a pulse setting for quick blitzing. 1-2 Speeds for dough hook（Heavy mixtures-Bread, Pizza, Spaghetti),3-4 Speeds for beater (Medium-heavy mixtures-Salad, Cookie, Crepes), 5-6 Speeds for a whisk,(Hight mixtures-Cream, Egg, Cake, Sauces). This household stand mixer can effortlessly for a variety of food for you. 🍰【Tilt-head & Anti-slip Design】 The tilt-head design of kitchen stand mixer can be easy to install or uninstall the bowl and accessories. 4 strong adsorbable silicone cups on the mixer's base, ensure stability and prevent \"walking\" during operation. When you lift up the top half of the stand mixer which will stop working to ensure your safety during the kneading process. 🎁【Good Ideal for Gift】The stand mixer for dough, for egg, for salad and sauces, which is a perfect gift idea for your family and friends. 3 Attachments are easily secured to the shaft, easy to use and convenient. Definitely one of the best appliances in your kitchen. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us. We will try our best to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znqAhCNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InteHome","source_asin":"B09655BJ93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09655BJ93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09655BJ93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
