window.products.push({"id":396442,"name":"Espro Press 32oz French Press","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FoI7K3ESL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Espro Press helps you make a clean cup, with all of the delicate flavours and aromas that fully express your coffee. You will taste the coffee, and not the grounds. And the cup you drink tomorrow is as good as the cup you drink today.It is robust enough for home, coffee shop and restaurant use.Two sizes available now:Standard single-serving size (European 3 cup, makes about 8 oz, or 1 North American mug of coffee)Table-serving size (European 10 cup, makes about 30 oz, or 3 to 4 North American mugs of coffee)Double wall vacuum-insulated stainless vessel keeps brew temperature consistent, and keeps coffee warm for over an hourDouble filtered:Primary filter 5-8 times finer than a standard French PressSecondary filter 9-12 times finer than a standard French PressDurable and easy to clean, home and industrial dishwasher safeUS and global patents pendingHow it WorksThe Espro Press is a precision coffee brewer. It preserves all of the freshly brewed flavours and aromas by micro-filtering twice with a unique metal filter. This micro-filter keeps grounds out of your cup, and lets the aromatic oils in.Step 1: Designed for Optimal BrewingExtracts pure flavours by fully mixing grounds and waterKeeps temperature constant and hot with vacuum insulationStep 2: Designed for Optimal FilteringThe first micro-filter (a) is vertical and reaches below the layer of grounds to the clean coffee - it also lets the aromatic oils seep through at the topThe second micro-filter (b) makes sure your coffee is very clean, so extraction doesnâ€t continue in your cupStep 3: Designed for Optimal EnjoymentPrecision brewing preserves all of the freshly brewed flavours and aromas, so you can enjoy them again and againThe vacuum insulated double walls keep your coffee hot after brewingThe buffer between the two filters greatly reduces extraction after brewing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FoI7K3ESL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESPRO","source_asin":"B00CH2XBPA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CH2XBPA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CH2XBPA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
