window.products.push({"id":396470,"name":"MOKARO Wall Adhesive Heavy Duty Hooks - Value Pack Large Utility Hooks Without Nails,Clear Hanging Hooks Value Pack for Kitchen Bathroom Office Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5192IeNh2aL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"☼Specifications *Adhesive hooks Size: 7.2cm x 7.2cm *Maximum weight: 22pound/10kg *Applicable: the wall hooks suitable for wood, glass, frosted glass, glass grid, ceramic tiles, metal, acrylic, non-paint walls and other hard flat surface *Stronger - Self stick hooks can bear up to 20lbs on the smooth tile surface *Safe -The adhesive wall hooks without nail can not damage the wall(except for painted wall and wallpaper). *Durability - The clear sticky hooks which is has PVC material and stainless can against corrosion and scratches, ensuring durability. *Utility hooks - 🔔Notice : ✘.We do not suggest you stick the wall hooks on the surface of water,dust,oil,wax.  ✘.We do not suggest you hang valuable and fragile items just use one adhesive hooks .(can use more than 3packs together). ✘.We do not suggest you use the wall hooks on painted wall. ✘.We do not suggest you hang more than 8.8lb/4kg for a long time. If you find the wall hooks is dirty, pls washing the adhesive surface and use it after dry in naturally. Do not touch it by your finger ✍How to use? -Cleaning and drying the surface where you want to stick the wall hooks on before attaching to. - Peeling off the plastic cover from the bulge. - Pressing the hooks from middle to edge, - Make sure that the adhesive wall hooks contact with the surface completely without airspace. - Waiting 12 hours after hanging weight effect is better. ✂How to remove? 1.Use the hair dryer to heat the adhesive hooks about 3 mins. 2. Insert a knife into the backing tape, and peel the tape off. 3. Pour cleaning agents like medical alcohol onto the surface of the remaining tape, and then wait for 1 minute. 4. Wipe the remaining tape off immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5192IeNh2aL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANBLUE","source_asin":"B07H96H86D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H96H86D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H96H86D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
