window.products.push({"id":396616,"name":"Yillsen Folding Wall Mounted Retractable Clothes Hanger, Aluminum Folding Drying Coat Racks Home Storage Organiser Space Saver for Laundry Room - Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jdQG8VknL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Retractable Clothes Hanger Rack is specially designed to conserve space and increase the utility of your closets and other small spaces. Feature: This folding hangers set is perfect for anywhere where hanging space is required.▲It's so convenient to install and use. Open and fold in a second.▲Premium aluminum is durable and sturdy to hang heavy clothes. ▲No matter for indoor or outdoor, it's an excellent helper for organization.▲Perfect for home bedroom, bathroom, living room, balcony, office and hotel. Specifications: Product Name: Folding/Adjustable Clothes HangerMaterial: Aluminum alloy Color: Silver Dimension:40 cm x 4.5 cm x 4 cm Open Size: 32.5 cm x 31 cm x 4 cm Bearing Capacity:Supports up to 25kg /55lb Package include: 1 x Clothes Rack Hangers2 x Anchor plug2 x Screw :How to Installation? 1.Draw two marks on the wall at which you decide to install the rack.Measuring the exact distance of the two holes,it is important.If the distance too short or too long,it will affect the stability of the rack 2. Drill a hole on each mark using a 6 mm (diameter) drill bit.3.Insert the anchor plugs, mount the bracket(grooves upward) using the screws provided.4.Attach the rack to the bracket. Quick installation! Notice: ☛Please follow the \"Product Install\" step by step.☛Please clean and dry the wall before install.☛Please do not let your children play it!☛Each rack along holds 6 to 10 pieces of clothes.☛Please note the brackets’ heads are upwards(If the direction is wrong,the rack will unstable) ,and after attach the rack to the bracket,please pull down the rack,let the bracket to the end in the holes so that the rack will stable completely.☛Please allow 0.1% defective rate, any quality or service issues, please contact us first, we are promise to give you better solution, thanks very much for support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jdQG8VknL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yillsen","source_asin":"B07WPVTZWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WPVTZWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WPVTZWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":396617,"name":"Whiskey Decanter Glass Set with 2 Glasses,Transparent Creative Whiskey Decanter Set, Whiskey Carafe For Wine,Brandy, Scotch, Bourbon, Vodka, Liquor (7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mj0APJavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Novelty Design】This whiskey flask carafe decanter is extremely cool.You can store it in your cabinet. Take it out when you want to have a drink, or share it with your friends.When it is filled, it gives the curves and edges much more definition. 【Premium Quality】The whiskey decanter set is made of high borosilicate glass, which is heat-resistant, safe to use, and not easily broken. The large stopper on the bottle is easy to grasp and remove, which can protect the whiskey in the bottle from evaporation. 【Large Capacity】 This stylish 25.3 ounces (about 750 ml) decanter and 2 exquisite 5 ounces (about 150 ml) whiskey glasses are perfect for enjoying your scotch whiskey, brandy, blender wine or exquisite American wave. This whiskey can enhance your drinking experience. 【Multi-Function】 Whiskey decanter sets fits perfectly to bourbon, cognac, scotch, liquor, gin, rum, tequila, vodka, sake, ice tea and juice. Unique style drinking accessories, new for red and white wine.Great gift and conversation piece at any party. Can also be used to serve water, juice, iced tea and other beverages. 【Awesome Gift】This decanter set is fully protected with polyethylene foam and comes in an exquisite gift box that will make others think you have good taste when you give it as a gift.Surprise your relatives and friends on Christmas, wedding, birthday, Father's Day or other holidays and fulfill every man's childhood wish. Of course it can also be equally suitable for parties, bars, families and other locations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mj0APJavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"crayfomo","source_asin":"B09XXG4XNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXG4XNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXG4XNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":396618,"name":"Fortune Cookie Food Glass Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qIcEXCk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2.05 Inches x 1.74 Inches x 2.56 Inches 5.2 cm x 4.4 cm x 6.5 cm Glass Hand Painted Mouth Blown Glittered Accents Gift Boxed Christmas is a time for celebrating with friends and family, and what better way to do that than with food! That's why we love these festive food Christmas ornaments and decorations. From fruits and vegetables to cupcakes and candy, these hand-painted and jeweled glass orbs are sure to add some holiday cheer to your home. Best of all, they make great gifts for the foodies in your life! So whether you're decorating your own tree or looking for a unique gift, be sure to check out our selection of food Christmas ornaments, and decorations. You won't be disappointed! Create a miniature party with these enticing food and drink replicas, meticulously crafted by hand. These yummy treats are an enjoyable view of your tree during the holidays. Come on and dig in! Each of our ornaments is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete.The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the ornament. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmarks of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qIcEXCk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B07H7BJD3Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H7BJD3Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H7BJD3Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
