window.products.push({"id":396692,"name":"Nuovoware Blender, 12 PCS Personal Blenders with 6-Edge Blade, 600W Blender for Shakes and Smoothies Blender with 2 * 20oz Portable Bottle, 3 Speeds f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K9PikB6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nuovoware Countertop Blender Features: * 2 Speeds with Powerful Motor - Two speeds and 600W high-power design can easily achieve uniform nutrition and various texture of ice cream in a few seconds.* Pulse Technology - Just turn the button to the \"P\" position and let the pulse technology penetrate the ice and frozen ingredients to become a drink with a smooth texture.* Non-Slip Base -The non-slip base with suction cup feet helps the smoothie blender to keep stable during using and is safe to use.* Large Capacity - The portable blender has 600ml and 300ml cups, you will be able to blend and drink from the same cup.* Easy to Clean - The blender cup and lid are made of food-grade BPA-free plastic, which is durable and can be washed directly with water. Specification: Packaging Content: 1 x Blender Host 1 x 6-leaf Blade Base 1 x 600ml Cup 1 x 300ml Cup 1 x Slotted Grinding CutterBase 1 x Flat Cover 1 x Hole Cover 2 x Sealing Ring Note: Please read the instructions before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K9PikB6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuovoware","source_asin":"B0C6PQ2GN3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6PQ2GN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6PQ2GN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":396693,"name":"Arcmira Automatic Nut Milk Maker, 20 oz Homemade Almond, Oat, Soy, Plant-Based Milk and Dairy Free Beverages, Almond Milk Maker with Delay Start/Keep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61df-np2abL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dairy-Free Nut Milk Maker - The Arcmira milk maker can make 20oz(600mL) of fresh plant-based milk in minutes from nuts, seeds, grains, and beans, which is an economical, environmental alternative for cartons of milk and a good way to reduce carbon footprint. Not only it can make lactose-free almond milk, cashew milk, oat milk, and soy milk, but also makes smoothies, hot & cold plant-based beverages. From now, you can take control of your nutrition and design different milks to suit your taste. One-touch Automatic Program - With the Arcmira milk maker, you can skip the soaking step, which means less grunt work for you to make vegan milk. It has various functions to meet your needs. The Room Temperature function is specially developed for almond milk and other chilled nut milk. Warm (140℉) for warm beverages. Hot (212℉) for making soy & rice milk. Also, it has Boil Water, Keep Warm(Up to 6hrs), and Delay Start(Up to 18hrs) functions. Self Clean for a 60s rinse cycle and easy clean up! Smooth Blending - Arcmira machine features a unique and customized blades which have been tested over hundreds of hours in our lab. It’s designed with 6-blade strong cross stainless steel blades. 2-blades are designed as shark blades so it can extract nutrients with ease. With sharp blades, you can easily handle a variety of food. The built-in quadrilateral stirring column can make the Ingredients collide repeatedly without any omission, ensuring the smooth taste of the beverage. Special Led Screen Design - The simple and smart LED screen makes the timing and temperature control more accurate than traditional milk makers. You can know the time of function through the LED screen. It comes with overheating prevention & automatic shut-off function. It also has beep sounds after the program finish so you don’t need to watch over it all the time. Come with Accessories - Our milk maker includes practical accessories for free: A nut milk bag, Cleaning Brush, Measuring spoons, and Recipe. All accessories are carefully selected by us to improve the experience of making milk. Enjoy a healthier plant-based diet with our nut milk maker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61df-np2abL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arcmira","source_asin":"B0C68KDL86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68KDL86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68KDL86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
