window.products.push({"id":396847,"name":"Cloisonne Articulated Fantail Goldfish or Koi Fish Ornament - Green 4 1/2 x 1 5/8 in by Kubla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sSu2EnU+L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This finely handcrafted cloisonne fish decoration is made of copper and covered with enameled coatings of dark green, seafoam green, black and white colors. It can depict a freshwater koi or a goldfish with a large fan tail. The ornament comprises of 4 articulated pieces in the body, plus the tail and fins, allowing some side to side movement. There are also 6-7 sparkly small faceted clear beads on the tail and 4 on each side of the body. Hang it on your tree during the holidays and/or year-round from a mirror, on a shelf or just about anywhere. All sides are detailed. Articulated: Parts hinged/spring loaded together allowing side to side or up and down movement. Cloisonne: Ancient Chinese art form of decorating objects (usually glass or enameled metal) by creating compartments separated by lines of soldered filaments (usually copper wire) to create wonderful artwork. Shelf: It will also sit upright on a flat surface for shelf decor. The fins may be \"gently\" bent to their proper position (for the top fin, picking it up by the string should raise the fin to the proper position). Warning: Frequent and/or harsh bending any parts may damage those parts. Not a toy. This item is designed for decor purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sSu2EnU+L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kubla Crafts","source_asin":"B09ZH4C1KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-396847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZH4C1KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZH4C1KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
